  "generated_text": ".. Compute the dot product of the vectors:\n\\[\\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix} \\cdot \\begin{pmatrix} -1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix} = 2(-1) + (-1)(1) + 1(0) = -3.\\]\n\n. Compute the magnitudes of the vectors:\n\\[\\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix} = \\sqrt{2^2 + (-1)^2 + 1^2} = \\sqrt{6},\\]\n\\[\\begin{pmatrix} -1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix} = \\sqrt{(-1)^2 + 1^2 + 0^2} = \\sqrt{2}.\\]\n\n. Use the dot product formula to find the cosine of the angle:\n\\[\\cos \\theta = \\frac{-3}{\\sqrt{6} \\sqrt{2}} = -\\frac{3}{2\\sqrt{3}}.\\]\n\n. Find the angle $\\theta$ in degrees:\n\\[\\theta = \\boxed{150^\\circ}.\\]",
  "grade": {
